(1,'DISP-2026-001',3,1,NULL,'EXCESS_WASTAGE','Floor 4 Slab Rebar Offcut Wastage Exceeded 2.5% Tolerance','During verification of RA Bill #3 rebar reconciliation, Delta Rebar generated 4.12% cut piece scrap versus contractual 2.50% allowance. Net excess scrap amount equals 3,420 kg of 20mm rebar.',324900.00,324900.00,162450.00,'DEDUCTED','Project Manager and Procurement confirmed excess scrap. Deducted BDT 324,900 from RA Bill #3 payment certificate with contractor representative signed acknowledgement.',1,'2026-02-14','2026-02-22',1,'2026-10-19 06:20:41','2026-10-19 06:20:41'),
(2,'DISP-2026-002',2,1,NULL,'MEASUREMENT_DISCREPANCY','Column Shuttering Deduction for Beam Intersections','Contractor billed gross column surface area without deducting 12 beam junction overlaps (184 sft). Developer QS team claimed duplicate measurement.',5152.00,5152.00,0.00,'RESOLVED','Joint measurement re-survey completed on 2026-03-05. Intersection overlap deducted as per standard FIDIC/CESMM rules.',1,'2026-03-01','2026-03-05',1,'2026-10-19 06:20:41','2026-10-19 06:20:41');
