(1,'INC-2026-0001','Loose Timber Shuttering Fell Near Walkway (Near Miss)',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19','11:15 AM','Tower A - North Perimeter Walkway','NEAR_MISS','MEDIUM','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,'During 7th-floor column deshhuttering, an unsecured 4x2 timber batten slipped and plummeted to the ground safety catchment net.','Absence of secondary tethering rope during stripping of high-elevation formwork.','Barricaded the ground perimeter with hazard tape; issued stop-work to deshutting crew.','Tethering lanyards made mandatory for all formwork removal tools; toolbox talk conducted.','Engr. M. A. Karim (Site Safety Officer)','2026-10-21','RESOLVED',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,'2026-10-19 08:01:05','2026-10-19 08:01:05');
